COMP 2404 Assignment #1
Name: Mohamed Azab

Purpose:
This program manages customers, bank accounts, and debit/credit transactions.
Transactions are stored in date order, pending transactions can be processed,
and successfully processed transactions are stored in the logged collection.

Files:
main.cc - Main control flow and provided global helper/data-loading functions.
defs.h - Provided constants, transaction type, and global function prototypes.
Date.h/Date.cc - Date class and date comparison/printing functions.
Account.h/.cc - Account class and debit/credit operations.
Customer.h/.cc - Customer class and customer account collection.
Transaction.h/.cc - Transaction class and transaction processing.
Bank.h/Bank.cc - Bank class and customer/account/transaction management.
Makefile - Builds the program and provides a clean target.
README - Program description and build/run instructions.

Compilation:
make

Execution:
./a1

Cleanup:
make clean
